# corpus/assist/en_proposed_rules.ass - ky vong cho 2 kind MOI (v2): article_an
# va lowercase_pronoun (CHUA co trong IssueKind - assist/src/lib.rs).
# QUAN TRONG: moi dong deu co tien to '~ ' (dong MEM) de corpus test
# (assist/tests/corpus.rs) KHONG assert - neu viet dong cung, test se FAIL
# vi engine chua bao kind nay. Khi engine them kind vao IssueKind: bo '~ '
# tung dong de bien thanh spec cung (hard) + bo comment nay.
# Dinh dang: ~ <cau>\t<kind1[,kind2]>
#
# --- kind article_an: sai menh tu a/an truoc am thanh (/ju:/ -> "a
# university"; nguyen am /aʊ/ -> "an hour" - theo AM THANH, khong theo chu cai) ---
He is an university student.	article_an
It takes a hour to get there.	article_an
She ate a apple and an banana.	article_an,article_an
That was a honest mistake.	article_an
We waited for a hour or so.	article_an
He is a engineer at a airline.	article_an,article_an
# Cau dung (se la cau SACH khi kind duoc implement - tham chieu chinh sach):
#   "A university is an hour away." / "An honest effort is rarely wasted."
#
# --- kind lowercase_pronoun: dai tu "I" viet thuong o GIUA cau (phan biet voi
# lowercase_sentence_start: kind cu chi bat DAU CAU THAT sau . ! ?) ---
~ When i get home, i will call you.	lowercase_pronoun,lowercase_pronoun
~ She and i have been friends for years.	lowercase_pronoun
~ My brother told me that i could borrow his car.	lowercase_pronoun
~ Between you and i, this plan seems odd.	lowercase_pronoun
~ i think, therefore i am.	lowercase_pronoun,lowercase_pronoun
# CANH BAO token: "i.e." khong duoc bao (dau cham tach tu); "iPhone" khong
# lien quan (hoa o giua tu) - engine phai bo qua ca hai.
